    "shell_execute_tool_desc" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Run a Shell command (via the iSH Alpine Linux runtime). Security contract: each command runs in an isolated process; there is no cross-command session persistence (but the filesystem and installed packages persist). Only /var/MiniClaw/ and mounted directories are accessible. Configured environment variables are truly injected into the process environment; $VAR / ${VAR} in commands are expanded by /bin/sh from the environment, so secrets need no plaintext and special characters cannot trigger injection. Sub-scripts and programs (e.g. python/node/aws/gcloud) can read these variables via getenv/os.environ/process.env. Alpine is a BusyBox environment; avoid bash-specific syntax. Execution notes: for long tasks such as installing software or downloading large files, explicitly pass a sufficiently large timeout. Commands are interrupted when the app goes to background or the screen locks (iOS platform limitation); break long tasks into steps (install → verify → use) instead of running the whole flow in a single command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "执行 Shell 命令（通过 iSH Alpine Linux 运行时）。安全契约：每个命令在独立进程中执行、无跨命令 session 持久化（但文件系统与已安装的软件包持久保留）；仅能访问 /var/MiniClaw/ 与已挂载目录；已配置的环境变量会真实注入进程环境，命令中的 $VAR / ${VAR} 由 /bin/sh 从环境展开，机密无需明文、也不会因特殊字符引发注入；子脚本与程序（如 python/node/aws/gcloud）可经 getenv/os.environ/process.env 直接读取这些变量。Alpine 为 BusyBox 环境，命令应避免 bash 特有语法。执行注意：安装软件/下载大文件等长任务请显式传足够大的 timeout；App 进入后台或锁屏后命令会中断（iOS 平台限制），长任务请分步执行（先安装、再验证、再使用），不要单条命令跑完整个流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
